flowchart TB
    START([START / user question]) --> classify[Classifier]
    classify -->|COURSES| courses[Courses Agent]
    classify -->|PROGRAMMING| programming[Programming Agent]
    classify -->|MATHEMATICS| math[Mathematics Agent]
    classify -->|ADMINISTRATION| admin[Administration Agent]
    classify -->|GENERAL| general[General Agent]
    classify -->|EMPTY / ERROR| fallback[Fallback]
    courses --> decide{Tool call?}
    programming --> decide
    math --> decide
    admin --> decide
    general --> decide
    decide -->|No| END([END])
    decide -->|Yes| tools[Tools: calculator / current_datetime / search_courses]
    tools -.->|Returns to requesting agent| courses
    tools -.-> programming
    tools -.-> math
    tools -.-> admin
    tools -.-> general
    fallback --> END
